<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss Life appoints Morax as new CFO.</title>
<headline>Swiss Life appoints Morax as new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Life/Rentenanstalt said chief financial officer Andreas Donatsch would retire from his position at the end of 1997 for health reasons.</p>
<p>Dominique Morax, chief executive and chief investment officer of Zurich Group's Zurich Investment Management (Europe), has been appointed as Donatsch's successor, Swiss LIfe/Rentenanstalt said.</p>
<p>Donatsch was also co-president and member of Swiss Life's corporate executive board since 1994.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
